# MrChromebox Full ROM SHA256 hashes — pinned at release time.
#
# Format (standard sha256sum): <hash>  <filename>
#
# HOW TO UPDATE THIS FILE
# -----------------------
# 1. Identify the current ROM for your board at:
#      https://mrchromebox.tech/files/firmware/full_rom/
# 2. Download the ROM and MrChromebox's own SHA256SUMS for cross-check:
#      curl -LO https://mrchromebox.tech/files/firmware/full_rom/SHA256SUMS
#      grep kasumi360 SHA256SUMS
# 3. Download the ROM, verify against their SHA256SUMS, then pin it here:
#      curl -LO https://mrchromebox.tech/files/firmware/full_rom/coreboot_tiano-kasumi360-mrchromebox_YYYYMMDD.rom
#      sha256sum coreboot_tiano-kasumi360-mrchromebox_YYYYMMDD.rom
# 4. Replace the placeholder line below with the real hash + filename.
# 5. Update FIRMWARE_URL in flash-firmware.sh to point to the same file.
# 6. Commit both files together; tag the release.
#
# SUPPORTED BOARDS
# ----------------
# kasumi360  HP Chromebook x360 12b-ca0010nf  (Intel Gemini Lake / Octopus)
#
# If adding support for another board, append a line for its ROM here
# and add its board name to SUPPORTED_BOARDS in flash-firmware.sh.
#
# PLACEHOLDER — replace before release:
@FILL_BEFORE_RELEASE@  coreboot_tiano-kasumi360-mrchromebox_@DATE@.rom
